 - `0181_stamp_unified_view` — Stamp legacy unification (read-layer): flag stamp_unified_view_enabled (default FALSE). UnifiedStampService merges v1 passport_stamps (GPS) + v2 user_stamps (achievements) into one deduped read collection (dedup by catalog_id backfilled by reconcile, else stamp_type|country|city; v2 wins ties). GET /stamps/me/unified always available; when flag ON the passport-card stampCount reports the deduped v1+v2 total instead of v1-only. NO schema change, NO data migration, both write paths untouched.
 - `0182_country_essentials` — Country essentials (curated travel-readiness reference): plug_types, voltage, frequency, drive_side, emergency (jsonb) per country_essentials table (54 countries seeded), confidence='curated' + source + last_verified_at. Flag country_essentials_enabled (default FALSE). Endpoints GET /countries/:code/essentials + GET /trips/:tripId/essentials (DB-first, in-code curated fallback, honest-null for uncovered countries, confirm-on-arrival disclaimer on every response). Plug/voltage engineering-standardized; emergency numbers curated w/ disclaimer.
 - `0183_budget_fx_conversion` — Budget FX: flag budget_fx_conversion_enabled (default FALSE). GET /trips/:tripId/cost-estimate?home=<ISO4217> now attaches a `converted` block (perDay/total bands in home currency) via lib/fx.ts (EUR-pivot over fx_rates, indicative disclaimer, null when rate unavailable — never fabricated). Source-currency estimate unchanged. Daily refresh scheduler (lib/fxRefreshScheduler.ts, env FX_REFRESH_ENABLED=true) re-pulls ECB rates from frankfurter.dev into fx_rates. Mobile: fetchCostEstimateWithFx (additive; fetchCostEstimate unchanged).
+- `0184_fsq_places` — FSQ OS Places (Foursquare) provider POI layer: fsq_places (per-city ingested, category accommodation|nightlife|food|culture|shopping|other, provider confidence + dataset_date) + fsq_city_ingests + flag fsq_places_enabled. Ingested by scripts/load-fsq-city.mjs (DuckDB per-city bbox extract from the gated FSQ parquet — NOT whole-world). GET /cities/:cityKey/places?category (flag-gated, FSQ attribution required). Adds hotels + richer nightlife/food/retail beyond OSM. Category map + transform shared lib/fsq/*.
